  "html": "<div class=\"pg-page pg-role-worked_example\" data-pg-theme=\"workbench\" data-pg-scroll=\"flow\" data-pg-role=\"worked_example\" data-pg-title=\"留数定理：把围道积分变成留数求和\">\n<header class=\"pg-head\">\n<p class=\"pg-eyebrow\">第 3 讲 · 留数定理</p>\n<h1 class=\"pg-title\">留数定理：把围道积分变成留数求和</h1>\n<p class=\"pg-lede\">先找奇点，再判断谁在圈内；圈内的留数求和乘 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi i</annotation></semantics></math></span>，圈外一律不算。</p>\n<ul class=\"pg-meta\">\n<li>例题</li>\n<li>约 10 分钟</li>\n<li>对应大题 15</li>\n<li>复变函数攻略 · 3.3 留数定理</li>\n</ul>\n</header>\n<nav class=\"pg-outline\" aria-label=\"解题路线\">\n<p class=\"pg-outline-label\">解题路线</p>\n<ol>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b4-s1\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">01</span>\n<span>找奇点</span>\n</button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b4-s2\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">02</span>\n<span>判断圈内</span>\n</button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b4-s3\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">03</span>\n<span>求圈内留数</span>\n</button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b4-s4\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">04</span>\n<span>求和乘 2πi</span>\n</button></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<main class=\"pg-flow\">\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-prose\" data-mp-block=\"b1\" aria-label=\"为什么用留数\">\n<h2 class=\"pg-prose-title\">为什么用留数</h2>\n<p>留数定理把复杂的围道积分降成有限个代数留数。关键不是算积分，而是判断哪些奇点被曲线圈住：圈内的留数求和，圈外的奇点直接划掉。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-callout pg-callout-key\" data-mp-block=\"b2\" aria-label=\"留数定理\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">核心</p>\n<h2>留数定理</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在简单闭曲线 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 内除有限个孤立奇点外解析，且这些奇点都在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 内，则 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Res</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_C f(z)\\,dz=2\\pi i\\sum_k\\operatorname{Res}(f,z_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 取正向。圈外的奇点不贡献。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-formula-block\" data-mp-block=\"b3\" aria-label=\"定理写法\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">定理写法</p>\n<div class=\"pg-formula-wrap\"><div class=\"pg-formula\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Res</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_C f(z)\\,dz=2\\pi i\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\operatorname{Res}(f,z_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pg-formula-label\">C 取正向</span></div><span class=\"pg-formula-hint\">左右滑动查看完整公式</span></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-example\" data-mp-block=\"b4\" aria-label=\"例题 · PDF 例 25\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">例题 · PDF 例 25</p>\n<p class=\"pg-example-problem\">计算下列积分，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 取正向：</p>\n<div class=\"pg-formula-wrap\"><div class=\"pg-formula pg-example-formula\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_{|z|=3}\\frac{z^2+1}{(z-1)(z+2)(z-4)}\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span></div><span class=\"pg-formula-hint\">左右滑动查看完整公式</span></div>\n<ol class=\"pg-steps\">\n<li class=\"pg-step\" id=\"b4-s1\">\n<span class=\"pg-step-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span>\n<div class=\"pg-step-body\">\n<h3 class=\"pg-step-title\">找奇点</h3>\n<p class=\"pg-step-text\">分母为零给出三个一阶极点：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=-2</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=4</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"pg-formula-wrap\"><div class=\"pg-formula pg-step-formula\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_1=1,\\quad z_2=-2,\\quad z_3=4</annotation></semantics></math></span></div><span class=\"pg-formula-hint\">左右滑动查看完整公式</span></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"pg-step\" id=\"b4-s2\">\n<span class=\"pg-step-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span>\n<div class=\"pg-step-body\">\n<h3 class=\"pg-step-title\">判断圈内</h3>\n<p class=\"pg-step-text\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|1|=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|-2|=2</annotation></semantics></math></span> 都在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z|=3</annotation></semantics></math></span> 内；<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|4|=4</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在圈外，不贡献。</p>\n\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"pg-step\" id=\"b4-s3\">\n<span class=\"pg-step-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span>\n<div class=\"pg-step-body\">\n<h3 class=\"pg-step-title\">求圈内留数</h3>\n<p class=\"pg-step-text\">一阶极点用 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{z\\to z_k}(z-z_k)f(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"pg-formula-wrap\"><div class=\"pg-formula pg-step-formula\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Res</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Res</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{Res}(f,1)=\\frac{1^2+1}{(1+2)(1-4)}=-\\frac{2}{9},\\quad \\operatorname{Res}(f,-2)=\\frac{4+1}{(-2-1)(-2-4)}=\\frac{5}{18}</annotation></semantics></math></span></div><span class=\"pg-formula-hint\">左右滑动查看完整公式</span></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"pg-step\" id=\"b4-s4\">\n<span class=\"pg-step-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span>\n<div class=\"pg-step-body\">\n<h3 class=\"pg-step-title\">求和乘 2πi</h3>\n<p class=\"pg-step-text\">圈内留数和为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2/9+5/18=1/18</annotation></semantics></math></span>，所以</p>\n<div class=\"pg-formula-wrap\"><div class=\"pg-formula pg-step-formula\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\pi i\\left(-\\frac{2}{9}+\\frac{5}{18}\\right)=\\frac{\\pi i}{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span></div><span class=\"pg-formula-hint\">左右滑动查看完整公式</span></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"pg-answer\"><span class=\"pg-answer-label\">答案</span><div><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi i/9</annotation></semantics></math></span></p></div></div>\n<p class=\"pg-pitfall\"><strong>易错：</strong><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=4</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在圈外，不能算；负向曲线要乘 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>；奇点恰在曲线上时定理不适用。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-callout pg-callout-pitfall\" data-mp-block=\"b5\" aria-label=\"留数计算的三个检查\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">易错</p>\n<h2>留数计算的三个检查</h2>\n<p>① 曲线方向：负向要加负号；② 奇点是否在曲线上：在曲线上定理不适用；③ 极点的阶数：二阶及以上用导数公式，别套一阶公式。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-check\" data-pg-check data-mp-block=\"q1\" aria-label=\"随堂检查\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">随堂检查 · q1</p>\n<p class=\"pg-question\">对下列积分，下列判断正确的是？</p>\n<div class=\"pg-formula-wrap\"><div class=\"pg-formula pg-check-formula\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_{|z|=3}\\frac{z^2+1}{(z-1)(z+2)(z-4)}\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span></div><span class=\"pg-formula-hint\">左右滑动查看完整公式</span></div>\n<div class=\"pg-options\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-option\" data-pg-option>\n<span class=\"pg-option-key\" aria-hidden=\"true\">A</span>\n<span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=4</annotation></semantics></math></span> 也要计入留数</span>\n</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-option\" data-pg-option data-pg-correct=\"true\">\n<span class=\"pg-option-key\" aria-hidden=\"true\">B</span>\n<span>只有 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的留数贡献，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi i/9</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>\n</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-option\" data-pg-option>\n<span class=\"pg-option-key\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C</span>\n<span>三个奇点都在圈内，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Res</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\pi i\\sum\\operatorname{Res}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pg-check-result\" data-pg-result aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></p>\n<p class=\"pg-explanation\" data-pg-explanation aria-live=\"polite\" hidden><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|4|&gt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=4</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在圈外；圈内留数和为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/18</annotation></semantics></math></span>，所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi i/9</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n</section>\n</main>\n<aside class=\"pg-rail\" aria-label=\"图示与速查\">\n<figure class=\"pg-figure\" data-pg-figure data-pg-states=\"3\" data-pg-figure-state=\"0\" aria-label=\"只有 $|z|=3$ 内的奇点贡献留数\">\n<div class=\"pg-figure-head\">\n<p class=\"pg-figure-label\">图示</p>\n<div class=\"pg-figure-controls\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn pg-btn-sm\" data-pg-action=\"figure-prev\" aria-label=\"上一步\">‹</button>\n<span class=\"pg-figure-state\" data-pg-figure-state-label>1/3</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn pg-btn-sm\" data-pg-action=\"figure-next\" aria-label=\"下一步\">›</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<svg class=\"pg-figure-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"只有 $|z|=3$ 内的奇点贡献留数\">\n<title>只有 $|z|=3$ 内的奇点贡献留数</title>\n<line x1=\"34.67\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"34.67\" y2=\"204.00\" class=\"pg-fig-grid\" /><line x1=\"258.48\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"258.48\" y2=\"204.00\" class=\"pg-fig-grid\" />\n<line x1=\"22\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"298.00\" y2=\"110.00\" class=\"pg-fig-axis\" /><text x=\"297.00\" y=\"124.00\" class=\"pg-fig-faint\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">Re</text><line x1=\"146.57\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"146.57\" y2=\"204.00\" class=\"pg-fig-axis\" /><text x=\"150.57\" y=\"13.00\" class=\"pg-fig-faint\" font-size=\"9\">Im</text><text x=\"142.57\" y=\"123.00\" class=\"pg-fig-faint\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text>\n<circle cx=\"146.57\" cy=\"110.00\" r=\"67.14\" class=\"pg-fig-ink\" fill=\"none\" /><text x=\"196.93\" y=\"55.64\" class=\"pg-fig-muted\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\">|z|=3</text>\n<circle cx=\"168.95\" cy=\"110.00\" r=\"4\" class=\"pg-fig-invert\" /><text x=\"176.95\" y=\"102.00\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\">1</text>\n<circle cx=\"101.81\" cy=\"110.00\" r=\"4\" class=\"pg-fig-invert\" /><text x=\"109.81\" y=\"102.00\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\">−2</text>\n<circle cx=\"236.10\" cy=\"110.00\" r=\"4\" class=\"pg-fig-invert\" /><text x=\"236.10\" y=\"95.00\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4 圈外</text>\n<g data-pg-state-group=\"0\" data-pg-active=\"true\"></g>\n<g data-pg-state-group=\"1\" data-pg-active=\"false\"><circle cx=\"168.95\" cy=\"110.00\" r=\"7.61\" class=\"pg-fig-ink\" fill=\"none\" /><circle cx=\"101.81\" cy=\"110.00\" r=\"7.61\" class=\"pg-fig-ink\" fill=\"none\" /></g>\n<g data-pg-state-group=\"2\" data-pg-active=\"false\"><circle cx=\"168.95\" cy=\"110.00\" r=\"11.19\" class=\"pg-fig-ink pg-fig-dashed\" fill=\"none\" /><circle cx=\"101.81\" cy=\"110.00\" r=\"11.19\" class=\"pg-fig-ink pg-fig-dashed\" fill=\"none\" /><text x=\"176.79\" y=\"97.69\" class=\"pg-fig-muted\" font-size=\"10\">−2/9</text><text x=\"111.88\" y=\"97.69\" class=\"pg-fig-muted\" font-size=\"10\">5/18</text></g>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"pg-figure-notes\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<p class=\"pg-figure-note\" data-pg-note=\"0\">三个一阶极点：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n<p class=\"pg-figure-note\" data-pg-note=\"1\" hidden><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z|=3</annotation></semantics></math></span> 内；<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在圈外，不贡献。</p>\n<p class=\"pg-figure-note\" data-pg-note=\"2\" hidden><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Res</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{Res}(f,1)=-2/9</annotation></semantics></math></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Res</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{Res}(f,-2)=5/18</annotation></semantics></math></span>；和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=1/18</annotation></semantics></math></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi i/9</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n</div>\n<figcaption class=\"pg-figure-caption\">只有 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z|=3</annotation></semantics></math></span> 内的奇点贡献留数</figcaption>\n<p class=\"pg-figure-takeaway\">先判内外，再算留数；圈外奇点直接划掉</p>\n</figure>\n\n<section class=\"pg-quickfacts\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">本页目标</p>\n<ul><li>按「找奇点 → 判内外 → 求留数 → 求和」完成围道积分</li><li>处理一阶极点与圈外奇点</li></ul>\n<p class=\"pg-label\">记住</p><ul><li>留数定理：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mtext>圈内</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Res</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_C f\\,dz=2\\pi i\\sum_{\\text{圈内}}\\operatorname{Res}</annotation></semantics></math></span></li><li>一阶极点：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Res</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{Res}=\\lim_{z\\to z_0}(z-z_0)f(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span></li><li>先判内外，圈外不算；负向加负号</li></ul>\n<p class=\"pg-label\">易错</p><ul><li>把圈外奇点也算进去</li><li>奇点在曲线上仍套定理</li></ul>\n<p class=\"pg-label\">答案速记</p><p class=\"pg-quick-answer\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi i/9</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>\n<p class=\"pg-label\">下一步</p><p class=\"pg-quick-answer\">下一页：泰勒展开</p>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<footer class=\"pg-foot\">\n<p class=\"pg-source\">依据：3.3 留数定理 · 设 C 为正向简单闭曲线，f 在 C 内除有限个孤立奇点外解析，则 ∮_C f dz = 2πi 等 2 条</p>\n<div class=\"pg-controls\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn\" data-pg-action=\"prev\">上一页</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn\" data-pg-action=\"reset\">重置</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn pg-btn-primary\" data-pg-action=\"next\">下一页</button>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>",
